---
// Personal space hero — chill, no CTAs, no corporate pitch
---

<section class="hero-section">
	<div class="hero-inner">
		<span class="hero-role">Software Developer</span>
		<h1 class="hero-name" id="heroName">Edwin Rodriguez</h1>
		<p class="hero-desc">
			Diseñando lógica de backend robusta, arquitecturas limpias<br class="br-desktop" /> y aplicaciones web enfocadas en rendimiento.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero-section {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 10;
		padding: 7rem 2rem 4.5rem 2rem;
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.hero-inner {
		max-width: 820px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.1rem;

		/* Subtle frosted backdrop so text is readable over the game */
		background: rgba(var(--color-bg-rgb), 0.82);
		backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
		padding: 2.5rem 2.5rem 2.75rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.25rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.hero-role {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.hero-name {
		font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 6rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -0.045em;
		line-height: 0.97;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin: 0;
		cursor: pointer;
		user-select: none;
		transition: color 0.25s ease;
	}

	.hero-desc {
		font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.2vw, 1.4rem);
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-weight: 400;
		letter-spacing: -0.015em;
		margin-top: 0.4rem;
		transition: color 0.25s ease;
	}

	.br-desktop { display: block; }

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.hero-section { padding: 4.5rem 1.25rem 2.5rem 1.25rem; }
		.hero-inner { padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem 2rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 1rem; }
		.br-desktop { display: none; }
	}
</style>
